libgedit-amtk
------------------------------------------
It is a library based on GTK. Amtk is the acronym for 'Actions, Menus and
Toolbars Kit'. It is a basic GtkUIManager replacement based on GAction. It is
suitable for both a traditional UI or a modern UI with a GtkHeaderBar.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  girepository-Gtk3.0-3.24.52-1
  libgedit-amtk5-devel-5.11.0-1bl1
  libgedit-amtk5_0-5.11.0-1bl1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.0-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.0-1
  libgtk3-devel-3.24.52-1
  libgtk3_0-3.24.52-1
  libintl8-0.22.5-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gobject-introspection-1.86.0-2
  libgirepository1.0-devel-1.86.0-2
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.0-1
  libgtk3-devel-3.24.52-1
  libintl-devel-0.22.5-1
  meson-1.10.2-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/gedit/libgedit-amtk

Canonical download:
  https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/gedit/libgedit-amtk/-/archive/5.11.0/libgedit-amtk-5.11.0.tar.bz2

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libgedit-amtk-5.11.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libgedit-amtk-5.11.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libgedit-amtk-5.11.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgedit-amtk-5.11.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgedit-amtk5_0-5.11.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgedit-amtk5-devel-5.11.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/girepository-Amtk5-5.11.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

